7777777,"mobile","previewSrc","Preview description","A real frame from the earlier Sprite Forge intro showing its generated Ryo character on a magenta keying background","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Related project",[91],"resourceId",{"_49":92,"_26":93},"Agent Sprite Forge","/resources/agent-sprite-forge/","What this recording shows","This short video documents the earlier 0.3 Ryo workflow, not the current 0.4 pipeline or a playable game. Asset generation, keying and packaging still require the relevant model routes, tools and human review.","limitations","Demo category","Development workflow","demoType","lead","2d","workflow","source-recording","recordingId","agent-sprite-forge","resource:agent-sprite-forge","resource","Combines reference art, generated animation, and deterministic processing into exportable sprites.","/resources/",{"_20":105,"_166":92,"_164":101,"_47":167,"_165":108,"_159":158,"_26":63,"_149":168,"_144":169,"_141":170,"_135":134},[113,114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":92,"_53":166,"_55":-7},{"_47":100,"_51":108,"_53":165,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":162,"_51":163,"_53":164,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":160,"_51":161,"_53":47,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":157,"_51":158,"_53":159,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":154,"_59":155,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":136,"_49":147,"_138":139,"_59":148,"_53":149,"_55":-7},{"_47":136,"_49":142,"_138":139,"_59":143,"_53":144,"_55":-7},{"_47":136,"_49":137,"_138":139,"_59":140,"_53":141,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":133,"_51":134,"_53":135,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_53":130,"_49":131,"_51":132},{"_47":57,"_53":125,"_49":126,"_59":127},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[128],{"_49":129,"_26":63},"0x0funky","identity","Identity & attribution","Independent project maintained by 0x0funky. No separate public project logo or institutional affiliation is confirmed. The maintainer uses a custom illustrated profile avatar, which is omitted because it is not an official project or organization mark. The robot mark in Agent Game Forge belongs to a different project and is not reused here.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[85],"dimensions","Development stages",[145,146],"stages","Assets & animation","Testing","Topics",[150,151,152,153],"tags","Agent Skill","Sprite pipeline","Animation","Asset QA","Project source",[156],{"_49":154,"_26":63},"Why it belongs here","Generates motion clips from an approved reference image, then performs background removal, alignment, loop selection, timing correction, and atlas packaging. It offers Godot, Aseprite, and web exports. For 0.4.0, the README reports parse-level round trips but no Godot, LDtk, or Aseprite editor-import verification. Import and visual acceptance checks remain necessary.","detail","Resource type","Skill","Category","2D development","category","summary","name","skill",[150,151,152,153],[171,172],[101],"assets","test",{"_174":175},"documents",{"_176":177,"_178":179},"en",[181,185,186,187,184,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,183,220,182,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241],"zh",[180,181,182,183,184],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mecha